{"id":13452956796,"name":"GoingTo2014 (ADVENT CALENDAR)","desc":"GoingTo2014 is an old roblox simulator of the years 2014E to 2015L. There are more than 35 games to play here. Buy items from the catalog to customize your character. Make your own group and find other people like you. Upload your own clothing.\nThis game is not done so expect a lots of bugs, inaccurate stuff and missing features.\n\nThe currency in this game (Robux/Tickets) is not the actual Roblox currency so any changes to your in-game account balance wont affect your real Roblox one.","path":"/game/13452956796-goingto2014-advent-calendar","slug":"13452956796-goingto2014-advent-calendar","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/427f36c41eb8149e2b7b13b0a0d22a8e4a9d4032bc7a083b4d29bf0122225ae6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bbcd95f6973c32ae3ed78ade5c782791/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":54,"visitor":26077032,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-17T13:51:02.101Z","creator":{"name":"GoingTo2014","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"GoingTo2014-Everything-free-27014","_id":"678a60467b2aaa370996239d","title":"Everything free","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78c31","gameId":13452956796,"name":"GoingTo2014 (ADVENT CALENDAR)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":13452956796},"features":"Last upload","tags":[],"script":"-- This script overrides the cost of items in your game, making them free.\n-- Place this in a Script or ModuleScript, depending on how your game is structured.\n\n-- Define a function to simulate \"purchasing\" items for free\nlocal function makeEverythingFree(player)\n    print(player.Name .. \" can now get everything for free!\")\n    \n    -- Example: If you have items stored in a folder\n    local itemsFolder = game.ServerStorage:FindFirstChild(\"Items\") -- Replace with your actual items location\n    if itemsFolder then\n        for _, item in pairs(itemsFolder:GetChildren()) do\n            if item:IsA(\"Model\") or item:IsA(\"Tool\") then\n                -- Give the item to the player (no cost)\n                local clonedItem = item:Clone()\n                clonedItem.Parent = player:FindFirstChild(\"Backpack\") or player:WaitForChild(\"Backpack\")\n                print(\"Gave \" .. item.Name .. \" to \" .. player.Name)\n            end\n        end\n    else\n        warn(\"Items folder not found!\")\n    end\nend\n\n-- Trigger the function when a player joins\ngame.Players.PlayerAdded:Connect(function(player)\n    -- Make all items free for the player\n    makeEverythingFree(player)\nend)\n\n-- Optional: Hook into other purchase systems\ngame.ReplicatedStorage:FindFirstChild(\"PurchaseItem\").OnServerEvent:Connect(function(player, itemId)\n    -- Override any purchase logic to make it free\n    print(player.Name .. \" is requesting a free item!\")\n    local item = game.ServerStorage.Items:FindFirstChild(itemId)\n    if item then\n        local clonedItem = item:Clone()\n        clonedItem.Parent = player:FindFirstChild(\"Backpack\")\n        print(\"Gave \" .. item.Name .. \" to \" .. player.Name .. \" for free!\")\n    else\n        warn(\"Item \" .. itemId .. \" not found!\")\n    end\nend)\n","owner":{"_id":"676602cda458dd5b2cfa343d","username":"J0kKidd","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/94f8c98b119e94079886cb1d0ff8590303dce85058000cd39456338b44302698.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/676602cda458dd5b2cfa343d-1738958257352.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"676602cda458dd5b2cfa343d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/94f8c98b119e94079886cb1d0ff8590303dce85058000cd39456338b44302698.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/676602cda458dd5b2cfa343d-173895